      <h2 id="supporting-encapsulation_optimizing-cpu-usage" class="group scroll-mt-20">Inspecting encapsulated namespaces<a href="#supporting-encapsulation_optimizing-cpu-usage" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
